  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Ohatra kaody, JSON Schema, ary maodelim-paikady azon'ny milina vakiana dia omena lisansa MIT raha tsy voalaza hafa. Azonao apetraka malalaka amin'ny tranonkalanao manokana izy ireo.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Teboka fidirana zo natambatra",
