  "Commercial use requires contact": "Mitaky fifandraisana ny fampiasana ara-barotra",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Nasaina taorian'ny Fihaonamben'i Bletchley momba ny Fiarovana ny AI, ary notarihin'i Yoshua Bengio miaraka amin'ny mpandinika mahery 100 avy amin'ny firenena saika 30 sy ny Firenena Mikambana, ny OECD ary ny Vondrona Eoropeana, dia mamintina porofo siantifika ankehitriny momba ny fahaizan'ny AI mandroso indrindra sy ny loza mety hitranga izao tatitra mahaleo tena izao — ary manamarika fa ny rafitra sasany ankehitriny dia mahay mahalala rehefa tsapàna ary mifidy hanova ny fitondran-tenany araka izany.",
