  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Mamadika ny fanambaran-jo ho tsena fanomezan-dalana azo ampiharina, fa tsy web roa lafiny (misokatra/mihidy) fotsiny.",
  "Copied ✓": "Voadika ✓",
