  "this site’s AI content rights policy": "ny paikadin'ity tranonkala ity momba ny zon'ny votoaty AI",
  "this site’s license catalog": "ny katalaogin-dalisan'ity tranonkala ity",
  "training / fine_tuning / distillation — model internalization tiers": "training / fine_tuning / distillation — ambaratongan'ny fandraiketana anaty modely",
  "training — model training and fine-tuning permission": "training — fahazoan-dalana amin'ny fampiofanana modely sy ny fine-tuning",
  "transformation — structured extraction and derivative works": "transformation — fanalana voarafitra sy asa vokatra avy amin'izany",
