  "verbatim_memory — whether exact reproduction is permitted": "verbatim_memory — raha avela ny famerenana mivantana marimarina",
  "versioned, citable, traceable": "misy dingam-pivoarana, azo tsipihina, azo araha-maso",
  "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” now published in English as the canonical edition; the Chinese original manuscript remains available and both versions cross-link.": "\"AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer\" dia navoaka amin'ny Anglisy izao ho dikany marina; ny sora-tanana sinoa tany am-boalohany dia mbola azo jerena, ary mifamatotra ny dikany roa.",
  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "Voamarina ho taratasy amin'ny fiteny Anglisy ny \"Protocolized Openness\" (misy andalana mifanindran-teny amin'ny sinoa) — tsy misy fandikana misaraka kasaina.",
